+
+```text
+无 POST 同名覆盖:
+Neeeeee! Good Job!
+fxck you! I hate English!
+
+debu 去掉末尾 %0a:
+Aqua is the cutest five-year-old child in the world! Isn't it ?
+
+shana[0] 与 passwd[0] 都为 1:
+Neeeeee! Good Job!
+fxck you! you don't know my password! And you don't know sha1! why you come here!
+```
+
